      "trace": "Authoredgaitprofile copies config.support_phase_radius as CycleDelta into LocomotionProfile. locomotion_profile admits the clampedrunratio as canonicalUnitInterval once; speed/cycle/height APIs receive thatsamecopy. CycleDelta is finite signed unwrappedcycles, not [0,1]phase; UnitInterval is finite[0,1]dimensionlessfactor. Both endpointparameters remainSelf andfractionparameterremainsUnitInterval until the operation."
