      "trace": "bevy reexportsbevy_internal; mathalias reexportsbevy_math; bevy_math reexportsglam; glam reexportsFloatExt. Actual FloatExttrait usesSelf for both endpoints/factor; actual implFloatExtforf32 fnlerp(self,rhs,t:Self)->Self computes self+(rhs-self)*t. self.0/other.0 are f32so receiverrequiresf32. UnitInterval::fraction returnsf32directlyatthatcall; no intervening firstpartyparameter/storage orsamefraction re-admission."
